The Recognition Garden scene identifiers and blur ceiling are updated.

The top-level `LAYERS` object is renamed to `GARDEN_LAYERS` so it no longer collides with matching names in other scenes across the shared global lexical scope. In [placeGarden](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-garden/public/color-polish/scenes/garden.js#L75-L97), blur computation is capped at 0.9 px to prevent far-layer bubbles from exceeding the readability ceiling during entrance scaling.

### What works now
